# Billowing Shriekmass (CR 701.17a, 207.2c, 613.4c): "When this creature enters, mill three cards" puts the top three cards of
# its controller's library into the graveyard; "Threshold — +2/+1 as long as there are seven or more cards in your graveyard"
# applies only from the seventh card on. Black Lotus is sacrificed for {B}{B}{B} (one card), Mox Jet adds the fourth mana: the
# Shriekmass enters and mills three Islands (four cards: a 2/3), then Faithless Looting off Mox Ruby draws two Plains and
# discards them, itself included (seven cards: a 4/4).

